us: IN_PROGRESS whenever any useful work can advance.\012- Set Status: COMPLETE only when every original gate and its required in-scope\012  follow-up/child checkboxes are implemented and verified. New children must neither\012  broaden original scope nor hide unfinished original acceptance criteria.\012  Otherwise use Status: IN_PROGRESS when material progress permits continuation.\012  Maintain exactly one of these status lines in the tracking file opening header, after an\012  optional # title and before the first ## (or deeper) section heading, outside\012  code fences. Historical status lines belong in sections below the header.\012\012When Runner context says Recovery verification required: YES, re-evaluate the\012persisted terminal status and acceptance evidence before trusting prior completion.\012The last session may have failed, timed out or exhausted quota after editing state.\012Preserve proven work and flags, validate remaining criteria, then continue ready tasks.\012\012\012Runner context:\012Runner role: WORKER\012Source roadmap snapshot: "/Users/bpstr/Github/assign/.codex/roadmap-runners/editor-pm/.roadmap-runner/prosemirror-editor-rewrite-31f010292871/source-147233508fcf.md"\012Source roadmap revision: 43639ad0e12e641d46cc56794524dcaf5707c04b18abd050498308c27d82c1ae\012Roadmap reconciliation required: NO\012Use this read-only snapshot for all source requirements in this session, not the changing live file.\012An external controller may revise the live roadmap; adopt later revisions only on the next run.\012Neither workers nor the periodic supervisor may edit the live source or snapshot, weaken criteria, or expand permissions/budgets.\012Recovery verification required: NO\012Blocked recovery mode: NO\012Loaded prompt revision: 7eaa063f3629\012Iteration: 39\012Session started (UTC): 2026-10-12T08:14:40.633Z\012
